{"id":970500,"shortDescription":"《秦殇》（Prince of Qin）是一款由目标软件公司开发的动作角色扮演游戏，该游戏已于2002年7月6日发行。本次进行重新上架，主旨是为了曾经深爱《秦殇》这款游戏的玩家在时隔20年后，能重新追忆当年的风采，特此针对现在的系统运行环境及显示器尺寸优化了分辨率，支持窗口化及1080P分辨率。","developers":["北京目标在线科技有限公司"],"publishers":["北京目标在线科技有限公司"],"categories":["Un jugador","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"10 ENE 2022","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1641899772","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_3e01611f1cf3f834634bb94e8de87776e948c9fb.600x338.jpg?t=1641899772","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_3e01611f1cf3f834634bb94e8de87776e948c9fb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1641899772"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_f9e6de2a8cd3d2c3c90d2a3b91d3f10220c02c4b.600x338.jpg?t=1641899772","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_f9e6de2a8cd3d2c3c90d2a3b91d3f10220c02c4b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1641899772"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_d4bdfd71a491d5f140309bb29be1d3e63a27e181.600x338.jpg?t=1641899772","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_d4bdfd71a491d5f140309bb29be1d3e63a27e181.1920x1080.jpg?t=1641899772"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_72158a62b133eedae1f1679d986cc0bcc8416e7c.600x338.jpg?t=1641899772","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_72158a62b133eedae1f1679d986cc0bcc8416e7c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1641899772"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_4028af37b8bc3288ebdcf80f5da7e226a8e10bb5.600x338.jpg?t=1641899772","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970500/ss_4028af37b8bc3288ebdcf80f5da7e226a8e10bb5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1641899772"},{